recommend keep-going the stereo EQ/filter class holds tone, shelf, band-pass, notch, bell, and the swept low-pass — the fixed-and-swept family whole; the next Lindy rungs carry the remaining mono filters (the deesser, the carried tone_carry) or open the stereo modulation class (chorus, flanger, vibrato)
